bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    native_build_shard_timeout_reported_as_crash_2026_11_11, 0, "A native-build shard worker reaped at the --timeout deadline was sealed CRASH (code -2 < 0) by run_ledger_shards in src/app/cli/native_build_main.spl. Stage3 attempt 3 reported 1267 CRASH modules that were really a 1500 s deadline, misdirecting triage toward crashes."

